e  contrary Nolte himself has claimed that  the photo in question was closer to  being a souvenir for one of the officers  present at the station  Hollywood Superstar Nicholas Cage was  already a well-seasoned actor by the  time he revved up audiences in 2007's  Ghostwriter this was a role he committed  to with the exact amount of hyperactive  enthusiasm he has been famous for since  his rival on the Hollywood scene way  back in 1981. his self-branded Nouveau  shamanic style of acting has earned him  one Academy Award and there's no sign of  him slowing down anytime soon though  there have been some false claims within  Cage's legal history the actor  definitely interacted with law  enforcement when a mug shot was taken  after the actor was arrested in New  Orleans during what appeared to be a  domestic dispute on the street onlookers  fly down police outside of residence in  the French Quarter in 2011 upon arriving  at the scene the responding officer  noticed immediately that cage was  heavily intoxicated  tell you the truth I'm a little shaky  right now he then escorted him down to  Central Lockup according to Reuters the  actor was photographed and processed  before being bailed out by none other  than Dwayne Dog the Bounty Hunter  Chapman after the case was reviewed by  the District Attorney's office it was  deemed that there was insufficient  evidence to charge cage with a criminal  offense according to CNN the District  Attorney's office did not give Nick Cage  any breaks because of his status at the  same time we are not going to judge him  more harshly either  Marvel's favorite leading man Robert  Downey Jr first started portraying Tony  Stark in 2008's Iron Man the film that  marked the official beginning of the MCU  not entirely unlike his on-screen bad  boy Persona RDJ himself has been  arrested on multiple occasions primarily  in association with drug-related charges  his long struggle with addiction and  Recovery has been covered many times  over some 